t","name":"topic:gdscript","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","color":"ffee88","default":false,"description":"","archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":2,"created_at":"2025-03-28T18:40:42Z","updated_at":"2025-03-28T19:24:46Z","closed_at":"2025-03-28T19:13:45Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nRepro'd in 4.4.1-stable.  Isn't consistently a problem in 4.3 but sometimes I've seen the inspector fail to show exported variable documentation.\n\n### System information\n\nMacOS Ventura 13.7 on Macbook Air M1\n\n### Issue description\n\n\nAfter converting my project from 4.3 to 4.4.1, hovering over script exported variables in the inspector never shows docstrings for them.  I get e.g.\n\n  Property start_in_orbit\n  No description available.\n\nSimilarly, hovering over a gdscript function in the script editor produces a tooltip that knows basically nothing, e.g. hovering over \n\n  health.receive_damage(100, self)\n\nproduces\n\n  Method HealthTracker.receive_damage()\n  No description available.\n\nSame with member variables.  Anything built into Godot does show proper documentation in tooltips / inspector.\n\nIn 4.3 there were of course no tooltips, and the inspector would sometimes fail to load my documentation and sometimes not.  Now it's consistently not there.\n\nIf I create a new project, tooltips and inspector do show docstrings as expected, so there's something about my 4.3-converted project that is failing to generate docstrings.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nNot reproducible on a new 4.4 project, but happening on my medium-sized 4.3 project without any errors in the console.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nI don't want to attach my project here, but I'd be happy to get it to any individual who wants to attack this.","closed_by":{"login":"michaelgundlach","id":5141333,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUxNDEzMzM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5141333?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach","html_url":"https://github.com/michaelgundlach","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/michaelgundlach/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104733/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/104733/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed","pinned_comment":null}